module Func_overflow_field
(* Generated by pal.

   One C declaration in the Palow memory model: the F* type of every parameter,
   the ownership its contract needs, and the body. The module opens exactly the
   earlier declarations it names. See palow.md.

   Where the translation does not cover something it says so and `pal` reports
   an error, so a generated file is never quietly weaker than the C it came
   from. `--palow-permissive` turns those errors back into comments, which is
   what a coverage run wants. *)

#lang-pulse
open Pulse
